  <h1>Your Dad Went Bald. That Doesn't Mean You Have To.</h1>
  <p class="vy-dek">Most men wait until thinning is visible to act. The ones who keep the most hair usually started years earlier. Here is what they know.</p>
  <div class="vy-byline">
    <b>By Jake Merrick</b><span class="vy-dot">·</span>Hair Health Contributor<span class="vy-dot">·</span>Updated July 28, 2026<span class="vy-dot">·</span>4 min read
